+// [TAG_HC_MATVEC_SPLITK_COLS] env GGML_VK_DMMV_SPLITK_AMD_COLS = max num_cols for the SPLITK path.
+// Default 1 = stock behavior (SPLITK never used for multi-token/multi-column matvecs).
+// N>1 lets the narrow-output matvecs of the HC machinery (m=320 k=10240, n=2..4) use the
+// 8-subgroup workgroup: parallelism per workgroup x8, serial k iterations /8.
+// Pourquoi c'est sur: les pipelines SPLITK sont deja crees pour tous les num_cols
